# Frame-time budgets for the default stress scene (8M entities) on the reference GPU; run with LIT_SEED=1.
frames 30
measure 180 idle 16.7
move 50% 50%
measure 120 hover 16.7
click left 50% 50%
frames 5
measure 120 selected 16.7
key G
move 52% 50%
measure 60 grab 16.7
key Escape
frames 3
key Space
frames 3
text dup
measure 60 palette 16.7
key Escape
frames 3
key O
frames 3
measure 60 outliner 16.7
key O
quit
